Since open source development workflows have moved towards services like GitHub and Bitbucket, we have decided to move SETools' repository to GitHub.  The project wiki is now available here:

https://github.com/TresysTechnology/setools3/wiki

The repository can be checked out using the following:

$ git clone https://github.com/TresysTechnology/setools3.git

Alternatively, use GitHub's forking features to clone the repository to your own GitHub account.

